and when a real bundle's real certificate identity is not the publisher this institution pins.
Against the REAL committed platform-pin.yaml, and against the two-document stream it forms,
real cosign really ACCEPTS platform's real committed evidence -- and the refusal that follows on
an estate carrying a major is reported as the designed refusal it is, never as a pass. It grades
what the bump MOVES (eco-system ticket 99): a bump that adds and retires no policy version
composes 'none' and passes without reading a standing version's evidence at all, an arrival
composes by RE-READING that version's own real committed evidence (never recomputed), and a
retirement still forces a real non-zero-exit FAIL naming the version. The weaker-than-declared
note prints and never downgrades. Eco-system ticket 105: the gate verifies platform's real bundle
with a cold TUF cache and egress blocked, exit 0, through its own CLI (G), and a wrong, corrupt,
retired or absent trust root refuses on the trust material and never on the network, cold and warm (H).
